    - x86-64 ABI: file:/archive/x86-64-abi.pdf
    - Syscalls: http://blog.rchapman.org/post/36801038863/linux-system-call-table-for-x86-64
  - "long mode", bootloader: http://wiki.osdev.org/Entering_Long_Mode_Directly
